  m_Text: "<b>Thermo-Tactics</b> \u2014 a capstone project: a turn-based strategy
    game about keeping the planet below 1.5 \xB0C, set in the Philippines.\n\n<b>Team</b>\nEdz
    Steinar Bederico \xB7 Jon Francis Gellido \xB7 Rodge Emanuel Ramos \xB7 Jherwin
    Reyes\n\n<b>Fonts</b>\nPixelify Sans and Atkinson Hyperlegible, SIL Open Font
    License 1.1\n\nMade with Unity 6. Results and progress are stored only on this
    device (SQLite)."
